   "lines": [
    "Both fare and accomo-",
    "-dations here are of",
    "the roughest; pork &",
    "potatoes being the",
    "invariable meal, except",
    "for what we shoot.",
    "But I like the",
    "men a great deal;",
    "and Nell and I are",
    "the greatest compan-",
    "ions. Elliott is a",
    "good shot; I am not;",
    "but I am improving",
    "steadily.",
    "In spite of enjoy-",
    "ing my hunting so",
    "much, I miss Alice",
    "dreadfully; I would",
    "give up everything",
    "just to see her",
    "sweet face again.",
    "In the evening we got all",
    "hands (male & female) together",
    "& sang hymns."
   ],
